## 5. Schema & Field Assumptions

| Table | Field | Type | Rule / Purpose |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `participations` | `participation_id` | `VARCHAR` / `UUID` | Unique identifier for a participant's visit. |
| `participations` | `employee_id` | `VARCHAR` / `UUID` | Links participation to the employee record. |
| `participations` | `programme_id` | `VARCHAR` / `UUID` | Links participation to the health programme. |
| `participations` | `attendance_status` | `VARCHAR` | Checked for `'attended'` to determine eligibility. |
| `employees` | `organisation_id` | `VARCHAR` / `UUID` | Primary source for organization context. |
| `programmes` | `organisation_id` | `VARCHAR` / `UUID` | Secondary fallback source for organization context. |
| `screenings` | `participation_id` | `VARCHAR` / `UUID` | Foreign key linking station records to participations. |
| `screenings` | `status` | `VARCHAR` | Checked for `'completed'` or `'approved'`. |

